# Local nonsecret values for the Admin Portal's Cloudflare Worker binding.
#
# NOTE: ADMIN_LOCAL_PREVIEW is deliberately NOT read from this file. The Admin
# Portal reads it from the shell environment when Vite starts (see
# admin-app/cloudflare.config.ts). The root `npm run admin:dev` script exports
# it for you. If you start Vite directly, export it in the shell:
#
#   ADMIN_LOCAL_PREVIEW=1 npx vite dev --port 5174 --strictPort
#
# To exercise the real Cloudflare Access path locally, run the workspace dev
# script instead, which does not set the flag:
#
#   npm run dev -w admin-app
